@startuml 用户登录时序图

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #e2f0ff
skinparam noteBorderColor #2d8cf0

actor 用户
participant "登录界面" as UI
participant "UserController" as Controller
participant "UserService" as Service
database "UserMapper" as Mapper
database "数据库" as DB

用户 -> UI: 输入账号密码
activate UI
UI -> Controller: /user/login
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: login(username, password)
activate Service
Service -> Mapper: selectByUsername(username)
activate Mapper
Mapper -> DB: SELECT * FROM user
activate DB
DB --> Mapper: 返回用户信息
deactivate DB
Mapper --> Service: User对象
deactivate Mapper

alt 密码正确
    Service -> Service: 验证密码
    Service --> Controller: 登录成功
    Controller --> UI: 跳转首页
    UI --> 用户: 显示首页
else 密码错误
    Service --> Controller: 登录失败
    Controller --> UI: 提示错误
    UI --> 用户: 显示错误信息
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate UI

@enduml
